Safety briefing slides for AG Algebra (building 48)

Build (needs Typst, https://typst.app; `brew install typst`):

    typst compile slides.typ

This writes slides.pdf. `typst watch slides.typ` rebuilds on every save.

Fonts: Fira Sans and Apple Color Emoji (macOS).

Layout:
- slides.typ   slide source; set `show-todos = false` to hide TODO notes
- img/         images used by the slides (downsized photos, crops, QR codes)
- Material/    original photos, forms and the official slide decks
- tools/floorplan.sh  makes img/floorplan-48-4.png from the official
               floor-plan PDF, with people's names removed
